<title>UK: BayerVB sets 400 million Dkr step-up 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 400 million Dkr step-up 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Kredietbank and BayerVB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON    *5.0	 MATURITY    10.JUN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.863   PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN STEPS-UP TO 8.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
